        <p>Croup, Whooping Cough, and ordinary . Colds con- tracted by children should be subdued immediately, If neglected, serious complications may arise, and the child's life be endangl'ed. VENG'S LIGHTNING Cocoa CURE has a world-wiae reputation, being a tar superior remedy to the common, cheap, syrupy mixtures so freqw.r.t y sold. It is endorsed by many eminent men, tecause it is a scientific remedy that gives universal satisfaction. It is a pleasure to see how quickly it acts upon a cough, especially in children. It clears the bronchial tubes, and gives perfect ease in breathing, be- sides strfugthening the system and overcoming the after eff cts. It should be kept in the house always ready for emergencier. A hook of Instructions accompanies each b)ttle. Price is. 41. and 2. 93. at all Chemists and Medicine Vendors, Ask for VSNO'S LIGHTNING Concur Cyan. A dealer will probably say he has one of is own t ell him yod want Vaud's, and insist upon it.</p>
