        <p>THE CLERKENIVELL MURDER: EXECUTION OF FAUGEROI4. —Martial Faugeron was hanged at Newgater Londun, on Tuesday for the murder of a watchmake named Hermann Jung in Clerkenwell. It will be re- membered that at the trial Faugeron alleged, in self- defnco, that Jung was a ringleader in a plot to assas- sinate Mr Chamberlain, and that he sustained hi s injuries accidently in a quarrel which fol owed Jung's suggestion that F-augeron should take part in the plot</p>
